    "detailed_description": "In this game you can explore almost any moon or planet of our solar system and visit remarkable nearby stars and see their location in the Milky Way. But you can also change existing bodies or add new ones and make a solar system of your own. The simulation will then act as a gravity and physics sandbox and recalculate orbits in line with Newton's laws.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is the desktop version of the mobile game &quot;Solar System Simulator&quot;, which on mobile has so far accumulated about 800.000 downloads. This desktop version offers higher quality texture and height maps and smoother gameplay. More features will be added to the game.",
